// Matching start and height share the row in source order.
rack "Shared Equipment" 8U 19in u1 bottom views front rear

8 switch "Core" as core
5 2U device "Compute A" as compute-a
5 2U device "Compute B" as compute-b
5 2U device "Compute C" as compute-c
rear 2 pdu "Power A" as power-a
rear 2 pdu "Power B" as power-b

core:1 -- compute-a:network
core:2 -- compute-b:network
core:3 -- compute-c:network
core:4 -- [[Upstream Rack]]
power-a:1 -- compute-a:power
power-b:1 -- compute-b:power
